n。既有依赖和构建体积警告保留。\n- 验收证据：progress/evidence/2026-09-15/M5.1-254a4ff-local-acceptance.json；secret-ack诊断包保留真实请求时序、RED/GREEN、并发412和独立审查；原6c/e480失败CI完整归档，不能以一次成功替代失败事实。新发布head的完整CI待回读。\n- 调用边界：生产source/proof注册表仍为空；Tutor/Run、检索、搜索及Codex尚未由本阶段接通。另一次用户授权的独立DeepSeek合成问题冒烟返回200、实际15tokens，其无秘密回执留仓库外；这不代表平台Agent、模型质量或学习效果验收。系统秘密后端仍仅有注入协议，本机实证为文件fallback；M7完整恢复未验。\n- 公开材料经逐项原件/派生hash、精确脱敏与路径/凭据检查；真实会话字段仅在公开副本去除，原失败保留私有。密钥及其摘要不进入提交。\n\n下一任务为M5.2本地检索；M5.3 Tutor状态机与M5.4真实模型评测继续独立验收。保持草稿审查，不自动合并或关闭任务。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T07:21:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T08:48:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"95ff6221219b146a598e134571954a8bcdab7160","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/49/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/49/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/49/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/f0b4ce2e39a3bc374751379051553108ad6a57ed","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M5.1-provider-consent","ref":"feat/M5.1-provider-consent","sha":"f0b4ce2e39a3bc374751379051553108ad6a57ed","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/subscriptions","orga